step	19	-	Quick guide step 19
line	<str>Talk to Commander Veldaban in Keldagrim, just west of the bank. This will begin a cutscene (note: If you click the east side of the bridge directly as the cutscene begins your avatar will migrate east during the cutscene).</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy 3 beers from the pub south of the drunken dwarf's house if you don't have them already.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the drunken dwarf in the middle of East Keldagrim (north-east of the kebab shop, there's a bar south).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again and give him a beer.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the rowdy dwarf outside the East Keldagrim pub, he will request a random item. Get it and bring it to him. (If you buy it at the Grand Exchange, use the free minecart transport north-west in the GE.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the tunnel under White Wolf Mountain (Optional: Buy White Wolf Mountain ticket (100 coins) from Keldagrim Cart Conductor to travel to the White Wolf Mountain tunnel. Use the south minecart track.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Khorvak in the pub under White Wolf Mountain .</str>
line	
line	<str>Give a dwarven stout to Khorvak. (If you didn't bring a dwarven stout, pick up the dwarven stout spawn from table in pub.)</str>
line	
line	<str>(Optional) Buy a Keldagrim ticket from the Cart Conductor under White Wolf Mountain for 100 coins (50 if Ring of Charos(a) is used) to get back to Keldagrim, or teleport to Blast Furnace minigame.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Gauss in the bar south of the bank (western side of Keldagrim). Give him cheers with another beer.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the "Kelda Hops Patch" just south-east of the bank. Speak with Rind The Gardener, or you will receive a message that you should ask for permission before using the patch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Plant the kelda seeds (there is a rake south of the patch).</str>
line	
line	<str>They will grow in 15–20 minutes and cannot die. You will get a chat notification when ready (you can be logged out while waiting).</str>
line	
line	<str>Harvest the kelda hops.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go upstairs in the East Keldagrim pub.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you did not bring ale yeast, buy ale yeast from Blandebir for 25 coins (empty pot spawn can be found near the vat).</str>
line	
line	<str>Add to the vat in this order:</str>
line	
line	<str>Wait 15–20 minutes for the notification again.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Turn the valve and use an empty beer glass on the barrel.</col>
